{"seq":3,"slug":"thompson-nfa","title":"Thompson NFA 模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata/thompson-nfa","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"thompson-nfa-模拟\">Thompson NFA 模拟</h1><p><a href=\"dfa-conversion\">子集构造</a> 留下了一个让人不安的事实：把 NFA 确定化成 DFA 可能让状态数指数爆炸。Thompson NFA 模拟的洞察是——我们根本不需要把整张 DFA 造出来。匹配某个具体输入时，真正会被「访问」到的 DFA 状态（即 NFA 子集）顶多和输入长度成正比；与其预先枚举全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个子集，不如在读输入的过程中，只维护「此刻活跃的那一个子集」。这就把指数的构造成本，化解成了线性的执行成本。这套方法是 1968 年 Thompson 原始论文的精髓，也是 RE2、Rust regex、Go 标准库正则线性时间保证的直接来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Thompson 模拟同时跟踪「所有当前可能处于的 NFA 状态」，把它们当成一个集合一起向前推进。读入一个字符，就让集合里每个状态各走一步，合并所有去向，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>-闭包，得到新的活跃集合。整个过程从不回头——输入只被扫描一遍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  INIT[&quot;活跃集 = E(NFA 初态)&quot;] --&gt; READ[&quot;读下一个输入字符 c&quot;]&#10;  READ --&gt; STEP[&quot;next = E(move(活跃集, c))&lt;br/&gt;所有状态并行走一步&quot;]&#10;  STEP --&gt; SWAP[&quot;活跃集 = next&quot;]&#10;  SWAP --&gt; EMPTY{&quot;活跃集为空？&quot;}&#10;  EMPTY --&gt;|是| FAIL[&quot;无匹配,提前终止&quot;]&#10;  EMPTY --&gt;|否| MORE{&quot;还有字符？&quot;}&#10;  MORE --&gt;|是| READ&#10;  MORE --&gt;|否| ACCEPT{&quot;活跃集含接受态？&quot;}&#10;  ACCEPT --&gt;|是| OK[&quot;匹配成功&quot;]&#10;  ACCEPT --&gt;|否| NO[&quot;匹配失败&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  INIT[\"活跃集 = E(NFA 初态)\"] --&gt; READ[\"读下一个输入字符 c\"]\n  READ --&gt; STEP[\"next = E(move(活跃集, c))&lt;br/&gt;所有状态并行走一步\"]\n  STEP --&gt; SWAP[\"活跃集 = next\"]\n  SWAP --&gt; EMPTY{\"活跃集为空？\"}\n  EMPTY --&gt;|是| FAIL[\"无匹配,提前终止\"]\n  EMPTY --&gt;|否| MORE{\"还有字符？\"}\n  MORE --&gt;|是| READ\n  MORE --&gt;|否| ACCEPT{\"活跃集含接受态？\"}\n  ACCEPT --&gt;|是| OK[\"匹配成功\"]\n  ACCEPT --&gt;|否| NO[\"匹配失败\"]</pre><p>和 <a href=\"dfa-conversion\">子集构造</a> 对照看，关系一目了然：子集构造<strong>预先</strong>算出所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(T, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并存成表，Thompson 模拟则<strong>当场</strong>算出当下需要的那一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(T, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 用完就扔。两者用的是同一个转移函数，区别只在「批量预算」还是「按需现算」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>子集构造（完整 DFA）</th>\n<th>Thompson 模拟（NFA 集合）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态构造</td>\n<td>预先全造，最坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不造，运行时维护一个集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每字符成本</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 推进集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总时间</td>\n<td>编译可能指数 + 匹配线性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nm)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nm</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，n 为状态数 m 为输入长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>最坏指数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是线性时间\">为什么是线性时间</h2><p>Thompson 模拟最重要的性质，是它对<strong>任意</strong>输入都保证线性时间——这与 <a href=\"../engines/backtracking-engines\">回溯型引擎</a> 形成尖锐对比，后者在恶意输入下会退化成指数。</p>\n<p>设正则编译出的 NFA 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个状态、输入长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。活跃集合最多含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个状态（一个状态最多出现一次，这是去重的关键），每读一个字符推进集合的成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，共读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 个字符，所以总时间是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在那个「去重」：因为活跃集是<strong>集合</strong>而非多重集，同一个 NFA 状态无论被多少条路径到达，都只算一次。回溯引擎之所以爆炸，恰恰是因为它会把「到达同一状态的不同路径」当成不同的工作重复探索（见 <a href=\"../engines/backtracking-engines\">回溯型引擎</a> 与 <a href=\"../advanced/redos-security\">ReDoS 与正则安全</a>）。Thompson 模拟用集合天然消除了这种冗余——这一行去重，就是线性与指数的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字节码视角下的多线程\">字节码视角下的多线程</h2><p>把 <a href=\"nfa-construction\">NFA 构造</a> 末尾提到的字节码模型接上来，Thompson 模拟有一个极其直观的实现叫 PikeVM（Russ Cox 的命名）。它把每个活跃的 NFA 状态看成一个「线程」，所有线程并行执行同一段 <code>Char/Split/Jmp/Match</code> 字节码：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>遇到 <code>Split L1, L2</code>：当前线程<strong>分裂</strong>成两个，分别跳到 L1 和 L2（对应选择/闭包的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 分支）。</li>\n<li>遇到 <code>Char c</code>：若下一个输入是 c，线程存活并前进；否则线程<strong>死亡</strong>。</li>\n<li>同一字符位置上，如果两个线程跑到了同一条指令地址，<strong>后者直接丢弃</strong>——这就是去重，用一个「本轮已访问指令」的位图实现。</li>\n<li>遇到 <code>Match</code>：记录一次成功。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个「同步多线程、同址去重」的循环，就是把抽象的集合推进落成了可执行代码。它与回溯引擎用的是同一份字节码，差别仅在调度策略：回溯用栈深度优先地串行试探，PikeVM 用集合广度优先地并行推进。两种调度的工程后果，是 <a href=\"../engines/engine-tradeoffs\">引擎取舍与特性边界</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"惰性-dfa-两全其美\">惰性 DFA：两全其美</h2><p>纯 Thompson 模拟每字符 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，比完整 DFA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 慢。工业引擎用一个聪明的折中把两者优点合并，这就是惰性 DFA（lazy DFA，又称 DFA on-the-fly）：</p>\n<p>它本质上是「带缓存的 Thompson 模拟」。第一次遇到某个活跃集合（即某个 NFA 子集）配某个字符时，就地用 Thompson 步骤算出下一个子集，并把这条转移 <code>(子集, 字符) → 新子集</code> <strong>缓存</strong>进一张哈希表；下次再遇到相同的(子集, 字符)，直接查表，成本降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。于是热路径上它和完整 DFA 一样快，又不必预先承担指数的构造和内存。</p>\n<p>为了对付 <a href=\"dfa-conversion\">子集构造</a> 里那只指数幽灵，缓存设有上限——当缓存的 DFA 状态数超过阈值时，引擎清空缓存（甚至退回纯模拟），从而把内存严格封顶。这种「按需构造 + 有界缓存」正是 RE2 和 Rust regex 的核心匹配引擎，详见 <a href=\"../engines/automata-engines\">自动机型引擎：RE2 路线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"捕获追踪的代价\">捕获追踪的代价</h2><p>Thompson 模拟有一个先天短板：它知道「有没有匹配」，却天然不知道「捕获组匹配了哪一段」——因为集合推进丢掉了「走了哪条具体路径」的信息（这正是 <a href=\"dfa-conversion\">子集构造</a> 合并子集的副作用）。</p>\n<p>PikeVM 通过给每个线程附带一组「捕获槽位」（保存各分组的起止偏移）来恢复这个信息：线程分裂时复制槽位，遇到分组边界指令时更新偏移，匹配成功时读出胜出线程的槽位。代价是每个线程不再是一个轻量的状态编号，而是一份带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个偏移的记录（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为分组数），于是带捕获的 Thompson 模拟复杂度升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot L \\cdot k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这也是为什么工业引擎通常先用极快的无捕获惰性 DFA 判断「在哪匹配」，再仅对命中区间用较慢的 PikeVM 跑一遍以提取捕获——一种典型的两阶段优化。捕获实现的完整工程细节，留给 <a href=\"../advanced/practical-features\">工程特性：捕获组、回引与 Unicode</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Thompson 模拟只维护「当前活跃的 NFA 状态集合」，按需推进，绕开了 DFA 的指数构造。</li>\n<li>因为活跃集去重，对任意输入保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nL)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 线性时间——去重是线性与指数的分水岭。</li>\n<li>PikeVM 把它实现成「同步多线程 + 同址去重」执行字节码，与回溯引擎共享字节码、只差调度。</li>\n<li>惰性 DFA 是「带缓存的 Thompson 模拟」，热路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、内存可封顶，是工业引擎的核心。</li>\n<li>集合推进丢失路径信息，捕获需给每线程附带偏移槽位，故常用两阶段：先定位再提取捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Thompson NFA 模拟","id":"thompson-nfa-模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是线性时间","id":"为什么是线性时间"},{"level":2,"text":"字节码视角下的多线程","id":"字节码视角下的多线程"},{"level":2,"text":"惰性 DFA：两全其美","id":"惰性-dfa-两全其美"},{"level":2,"text":"捕获追踪的代价","id":"捕获追踪的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"子集构造：NFA 转 DFA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/automata/dfa-conversion"},"next":{"title":"回溯型引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/engines/backtracking-engines"}}